		{"id":"uncertainty","type":"text","x":0,"y":609,"width":460,"height":154,"color":"2","text":"### Uncertainty\n\n- Mechanisms come largely from animal preparations\n- Heritability is a population statistic\n- Group imaging differences are not individual tests"},
		{"id":"hypothesis","type":"text","x":0,"y":823,"width":460,"height":232,"color":"6","text":"### Open questions\n\n- How much of circuit behaviour depends on glial signalling?\n- What cellular changes produce a measured thickness difference?\n- How do channel distributions differ between cell types in ways that change signalling?"},
